       •  The  caller  can  force the close‐on‐exec flag to be set for the new
          file descriptor by specifying OO__CCLLOOEEXXEECC in _f_l_a_g_s.  See the  descrip‐
          tion of the same flag in ooppeenn(2) for reasons why this may be useful.

       •  If _o_l_d_f_d equals _n_e_w_f_d, then dduupp33() fails with the error EEIINNVVAALL.

